SUMMARY:Impromptu: Advanced B Ride(16-17 Mph)EP Hammer Creek Short (21F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Vern Wheeler
 \nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep!\nAnticipated Average Pace: (16-17 mph)\nRoute
 : [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-hammer-creek-short-21f/](ht
 tps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-hammer-creek-short-21f/)\n\nThis
  is an Advanced B ride and C Riders that want to try and step up to a B pa
 ce are encouraged to join. We will be keeping a B- pace for this ride to k
 eep everyone together and work on group skills. The ride leader will ride 
 at the advertised average speed or the pace of the group. This is intended
  to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader 
 will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regrouping
 s.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the
  group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and
  encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16-17 mph average is 
 beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride 
 first.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic 
 repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate p
 assing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and 
 Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are
  a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to 
 abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nGuidance if an inc
 ident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.asp
 x?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3158520
 66/
